    // See Aras Pranckevi\u010Dius' post Encoding Floats to RGBA
    // http://aras-p.info/blog/2009/07/30/encoding-floats-to-rgba-the-final/
    return dot(packedDepth, vec4(1.0, 1.0 / 255.0, 1.0 / 65025.0, 1.0 / 16581375.0));
